      "value": "true avatar culling exist but that only does over culling of avatars.....\n\nwhat i'm tying to get at is when the user have the avatar culling on say at 20 meters cuz the user wants to be able to see far enough but dont want its mirror no more thn 3-5 meters.....\n\nits counter intuitive to render something so far over something that is behind us, when our motor functions compels us to move forward\n\njust a example to put out...but for now is for now",
