  "details": "Ability to reduce the range to render players.\n\nIts great that we can render players in our mirror(s), but in situations for example \" MidNight Bar \" . We don't need to render players who are inside bar while outside.\n\nthe ability to set a range for the mirror to actively render player would ideally improve the mirror's performance as an option.\n\nideal range? 3m-100m and option for standard culling.",
